{"id":"n38082-1-7","stage":5,"title":"기웃거리다 · 探头探脑","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38082-1-7-1","ko":"왜 내 자리를 기웃거리니?","zh":"你怎么在我座位这儿东张西望的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"자리를","meaning":"座位，席位","explanation":"자리：座位，席位；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"자리","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60332","senseId":"3","lemma":"자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자리를","audio":"/audio/516d8c7572e851763074.mp3"}},{"text":"기웃거리니?","meaning":"探头探脑，东张西望","explanation":"기웃거리다：探头探脑，东张西望；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"기웃거리다","audio":"/audio/05a288a3ccfa44e53f79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38082","senseId":"1","lemma":"기웃거리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기웃거리니","audio":"/audio/9c4ac9fa87ebe64293d0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"0f4adfe312e61750","term":"자리","zh":"座位，席位","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3","entryId":"60332","definition":"供人坐的地方。","pronunciation":["자리"]},{"id":"05a288a3ccfa44e5","term":"기웃거리다","zh":"探头探脑，东张西望","audio":"/audio/05a288a3ccfa44e53f79.mp3","entryId":"38082","definition":"为了看或找什么东西而一直斜着脖子或身子往四处张望。","pronunciation":["기욷꺼리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fc3e72f45b302fade02a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n38082-1-7-2","ko":"내 잃어버린 물건이 혹시 여기에 있나 싶어서 잠깐 찾아봤어.","zh":"我在想我丢失的东西会不会在这里，所以随便看看而已。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"잃어버린","meaning":"丢，丢失，遗失","explanation":"잃어버리다：丢，丢失，遗失；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"잃어버리다","audio":"/audio/9cf9d89321e22dcf7c31.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68753","senseId":"1","lemma":"잃어버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잃어버린","audio":"/audio/870c0d8437bddb80f7e4.mp3"}},{"text":"물건이","meaning":"东西，物品，物件","explanation":"물건：东西，物品，物件；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물건","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66247","senseId":"1","lemma":"물건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물건이","audio":"/audio/467d4d94d33d4871f929.mp3"}},{"text":"혹시","meaning":"是不是，是否","explanation":"혹시：是不是，是否。","readings":[{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87955","senseId":"4","lemma":"혹시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}},{"text":"여기에","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기에","audio":"/audio/89d8715c5ec0d5fb9df5.mp3"}},{"text":"있나","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있나","audio":"/audio/54242f507cd667676232.mp3"}},{"text":"싶어서","meaning":"要，想","explanation":"싶다：要，想；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"싶다","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62657","senseId":"1","lemma":"싶다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싶어서","audio":"/audio/01c2c48b3073c6e67a29.mp3"}},{"text":"잠깐","meaning":"暂时，一会儿，片刻","explanation":"잠깐：暂时，一会儿，片刻。","readings":[{"term":"잠깐","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57312","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠깐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠깐","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3"}},{"text":"찾아봤어.","meaning":"查找，翻找","explanation":"찾아보다：查找，翻找；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"찾아보다","audio":"/audio/a3eafbcd1004a6ce98a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29758","senseId":"2","lemma":"찾아보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾아봤어","audio":"/audio/4d8b482ba0592ac37a78.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"9cf9d89321e22dcf","term":"잃어버리다","zh":"丢，丢失，遗失","audio":"/audio/9cf9d89321e22dcf7c31.mp3","entryId":"68753","definition":"丢掉原本拥有的东西而不再拥有。","pronunciation":["이러버리다"]},{"id":"df279371093362d8","term":"물건","zh":"东西，物品，物件","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3","entryId":"66247","definition":"具有一定形状的某种物质。","pronunciation":["물건"]},{"id":"c99406fc3132c80d","term":"혹시","zh":"是不是，是否","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3","entryId":"87955","definition":"用于对不确定的事情提出疑问，表示虽认为如此，但因不确定而犹豫要不要说。","pronunciation":["혹씨"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"b3ad33de22cbca64","term":"싶다","zh":"要，想","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3","entryId":"62657","definition":"表示有做前面内容的意图或欲望。","pronunciation":["십따"]},{"id":"4e073566099677ea","term":"잠깐","zh":"暂时，一会儿，片刻","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3","entryId":"57312","definition":"非常短的时间。","pronunciation":["잠깐"]},{"id":"a3eafbcd1004a6ce","term":"찾아보다","zh":"查找，翻找","audio":"/audio/a3eafbcd1004a6ce98a6.mp3","entryId":"29758","definition":"为了得到想要的信息而仔细观察。","pronunciation":["차자보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/691b0b0a49f8c4379267.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.402,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=38082","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":162,"sequenceScore":3.2287,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我在想我丢失的东西会不会在这里，所以随便看看而已。","智秀个子高，体格也不错，但看起来好像很胆小。","你怎么在我座位这儿东张西望的？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我在想我丢失的东西会不会在这里，所以随便看看而已。","你怎么在我座位这儿东张西望的？","智秀个子高，体格也不错，但看起来好像很胆小。"],"answer":0}]}
